      "content": "but therapy feels like just another thing i have to \"perform\" for. like i have to go there and pretend i'm getting better so people stop looking at me like i'm dying. it's just so exhausting when even the help feels like more work and more pretending. i just want things to be quiet. i want the noise to stop.",
