    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"resting\" implies i'll eventually wake up and have to do it all again tomorrow. and tomorrow is just going to be as loud and as hard as today. sometimes i feel like the only way to actually get that quiet is to just... not be here anymore. like, is it even wrong to want to just opt out when the game is rigged against you from the start?",
